BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 728 Tm (Discuss: What would it take for someone in Chico to move from an emergency bed to a stable home?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 705 Tm (2. "Everyone experiencing homelessness has an addiction.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 691 Tm (Look closer: People without housing have diverse backgrounds. Substance use and mental health) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 679 Tm (needs can be serious, but they do not define every person or by themselves explain the local) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 667 Tm (housing market. Avoid using someone's appearance as a diagnosis.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 650 Tm (Discuss: What evidence would we need to support a claim about the causes of homelessness in Chico?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 627 Tm (3. "If someone refuses shelter, they refuse help.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 613 Tm (Look closer: A shelter may be inaccessible or unworkable for some people because of family) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 601 Tm (separation, pets, curfews, safety concerns, work schedules, or other rules. A declined placement) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 589 Tm (is not proof that someone refuses housing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 572 Tm (Discuss: What alternatives are available when one option is unsuitable?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 549 Tm (4. "Why don't they just get a job?") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 535 Tm (Look closer: Employment and homelessness can occur together. Work does not automatically pay) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 523 Tm (enough for a rental, and sleeping outside can make basic work routines much harder. Compare actual) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 511 Tm (local wages and housing prices before judging an individual's efforts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 494 Tm (Discuss: Could a part-time worker afford a room in Chico today?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 471 Tm (5. "Homeless people mostly came here from somewhere else.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 457 Tm (Look closer: This is a claim that requires local evidence. Point-in-Time surveys and related) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 445 Tm (studies may ask about residence before homelessness, but their methods and populations differ. Do) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 433 Tm (not turn an anecdote into a statistic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 416 Tm (Discuss: What do current Butte County data actually tell us ... and what do they leave out?) Tj ET
