BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 379 Tm (Look closer: Removing a campsite may change where homelessness is visible. It does not, by itself,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 367 Tm (mean the people who lived there obtained housing. Distinguish displacement from verified housing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 355 Tm (outcomes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 338 Tm (Discuss: What should Chico measure after enforcement or outreach?) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 315 Tm (7. "Homelessness only means people sleeping in tents.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 301 Tm (Look closer: Families, seniors, young people, workers, and people staying temporarily with others) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 289 Tm (may face serious housing instability even when they are not visible on the street. Different data) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.3 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 277 Tm (programs use different definitions and counts.) Tj ET
